OL,3,GNEWSAAntisocial driving 'problematic
OL,4,Aand unsettling'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Sussex county councillor has
OL,7,Fsaid that persistent antisocial driving
OL,8,Fon two A-roads in Horsham is
OL,9,F"problematic and very unsettling for a
OL,10,Flot of people".
OL,12,FResidents are concerned about late
OL,13,Fnight antisocial driving on both the
OL,14,FA24, which has Southwater to the west,
OL,15,Fand the A264 between Horsham and
OL,16,FCrawley, which is a key road for
OL,17,FKilnwood Vale, Faygate and Colgate.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
