OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAntisocial driving 'problematic
OL,4,Aand unsettling'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlex Jeffery, who represents Southwater
OL,7,Fand Nuthurst, believes the police "do
OL,8,Fnot have the resources" to address the
OL,9,Fissue and that "racers have cottoned on
OL,10,Fto that".
OL,12,FCh Insp James Davidson, from Sussex
OL,13,FPolice, said the force is aware of the
OL,14,Fconcerns raised and will "pursue
OL,15,Fprosecutions against drivers we can
OL,16,Fidentify".
